Subject: [PATCH 21/28] pipeline/lite_parsed: out-of-line dtor so
 vector<LiteParsedPipeline> instantiates where complete

Declare the destructor in the header and define it out-of-line in the .cpp,
where LiteParsedPipeline is complete, so the vector is only instantiated there.
